[
  {
    "text": "to depart for her new homes",
    "start_ind": 194,
    "end_ind": 221
  },
  {
    "text": "she imagined herself going",
    "start_ind": 331,
    "end_ind": 357
  },
  {
    "text": "they'll meet me in a sleigh",
    "start_ind": 371,
    "end_ind": 398
  },
  {
    "text": "here comes Miss Powers",
    "start_ind": 599,
    "end_ind": 621
  },
  {
    "text": "let us go to greet her",
    "start_ind": 623,
    "end_ind": 645
  },
  {
    "text": "came marching along the platform",
    "start_ind": 687,
    "end_ind": 719
  },
  {
    "text": "TRAVELING NORTH",
    "start_ind": 14,
    "end_ind": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "going North",
    "start_ind": 915,
    "end_ind": 926
  },
  {
    "text": "we had\nplanned to go to-morrow",
    "start_ind": 1079,
    "end_ind": 1109
  },
  {
    "text": "I don't want to go to Aunt\nIsabel's",
    "start_ind": 1658,
    "end_ind": 1693
  },
  {
    "text": "Come",
    "start_ind": 1833,
    "end_ind": 1837
  },
  {
    "text": "come",
    "start_ind": 1839,
    "end_ind": 1843
  },
  {
    "text": "you're only going for a visit",
    "start_ind": 2058,
    "end_ind": 2087
  },
  {
    "text": "coming after you",
    "start_ind": 2215,
    "end_ind": 2231
  },
  {
    "text": "they all climbed aboard",
    "start_ind": 2319,
    "end_ind": 2342
  },
  {
    "text": "you reach\nAunt Isabel's",
    "start_ind": 3049,
    "end_ind": 3072
  },
  {
    "text": "gone to your room",
    "start_ind": 3094,
    "end_ind": 3111
  },
  {
    "text": "Mr. Fairfield left the car",
    "start_ind": 3272,
    "end_ind": 3298
  },
  {
    "text": "you're going away from him",
    "start_ind": 3687,
    "end_ind": 3713
  },
  {
    "text": "You've got to go",
    "start_ind": 3730,
    "end_ind": 3746
  },
  {
    "text": "as they flew by",
    "start_ind": 4391,
    "end_ind": 4406
  },
  {
    "text": "a\nwaiter came through the car",
    "start_ind": 4450,
    "end_ind": 4479
  },
  {
    "text": "they would go to\nthe dining-car",
    "start_ind": 4555,
    "end_ind": 4586
  },
  {
    "text": "she was flying through the country",
    "start_ind": 4711,
    "end_ind": 4745
  },
  {
    "text": "they\nslid through a thick grove",
    "start_ind": 4843,
    "end_ind": 4874
  },
  {
    "text": "then out",
    "start_ind": 4879,
    "end_ind": 4887
  },
  {
    "text": "go out",
    "start_ind": 5555,
    "end_ind": 5561
  },
  {
    "text": "come back",
    "start_ind": 5634,
    "end_ind": 5643
  },
  {
    "text": "refuse to go",
    "start_ind": 5851,
    "end_ind": 5863
  },
  {
    "text": "it should run away",
    "start_ind": 5910,
    "end_ind": 5928
  },
  {
    "text": "never come back",
    "start_ind": 5933,
    "end_ind": 5948
  },
  {
    "text": "the ones that ran away",
    "start_ind": 6704,
    "end_ind": 6726
  },
  {
    "text": "the thought of tucking herself away in one of those queer-looking\nbunks",
    "start_ind": 6980,
    "end_ind": 7051
  },
  {
    "text": "I've no desire to climb up there",
    "start_ind": 7199,
    "end_ind": 7231
  },
  {
    "text": "up I go",
    "start_ind": 7468,
    "end_ind": 7475
  },
  {
    "text": "two jumps and a spring she landed in the upper berth",
    "start_ind": 7488,
    "end_ind": 7540
  },
  {
    "text": "then slide in",
    "start_ind": 7923,
    "end_ind": 7936
  },
  {
    "text": "the train came puffing\ninto the great train-shed in Jersey City",
    "start_ind": 8281,
    "end_ind": 8344
  },
  {
    "text": "It had passed through Elmbridge",
    "start_ind": 8347,
    "end_ind": 8378
  },
  {
    "text": "to meet Patty at Jersey City",
    "start_ind": 8498,
    "end_ind": 8526
  },
  {
    "text": "take her\nback home with him",
    "start_ind": 8531,
    "end_ind": 8558
  },
  {
    "text": "he entered the car",
    "start_ind": 8599,
    "end_ind": 8617
  },
  {
    "text": "ran to greet\nhim",
    "start_ind": 8623,
    "end_ind": 8639
  },
  {
    "text": "I've come",
    "start_ind": 9045,
    "end_ind": 9054
  },
  {
    "text": "to carry you off",
    "start_ind": 9055,
    "end_ind": 9071
  },
  {
    "text": "they all left the train",
    "start_ind": 9197,
    "end_ind": 9220
  },
  {
    "text": "Miss Powers was to cross the ferry to New\nYork",
    "start_ind": 9222,
    "end_ind": 9268
  },
  {
    "text": "Patty and Uncle Robert escorted her to the ferry-boat",
    "start_ind": 9273,
    "end_ind": 9326
  },
  {
    "text": "we'll go out to Elmbridge",
    "start_ind": 9454,
    "end_ind": 9479
  },
  {
    "text": "pick up Ethelyn, whom I left in the waiting-room",
    "start_ind": 9523,
    "end_ind": 9571
  },
  {
    "text": "she flew at her cousin",
    "start_ind": 9693,
    "end_ind": 9715
  },
  {
    "text": "she\nentered the door",
    "start_ind": 9727,
    "end_ind": 9747
  },
  {
    "text": "We always go to New York",
    "start_ind": 11077,
    "end_ind": 11101
  },
  {
    "text": "let us get aboard",
    "start_ind": 11260,
    "end_ind": 11277
  },
  {
    "text": "They went through one of a whole row of little gates",
    "start_ind": 11281,
    "end_ind": 11333
  },
  {
    "text": "crowds of people moving",
    "start_ind": 11402,
    "end_ind": 11425
  },
  {
    "text": "They hurried along the platform",
    "start_ind": 11550,
    "end_ind": 11581
  },
  {
    "text": "hurried into\na car",
    "start_ind": 11586,
    "end_ind": 11604
  },
  {
    "text": "the home she was going\nto",
    "start_ind": 11788,
    "end_ind": 11813
  },
  {
    "text": "The train stopped at Elmbridge",
    "start_ind": 11883,
    "end_ind": 11913
  },
  {
    "text": "Ethelyn\npiloted Patty off the car",
    "start_ind": 11951,
    "end_ind": 11984
  },
  {
    "text": "handed the young ladies in",
    "start_ind": 12108,
    "end_ind": 12134
  },
  {
    "text": "Mr. St. Clair came",
    "start_ind": 12560,
    "end_ind": 12578
  },
  {
    "text": "he\nseated himself",
    "start_ind": 12622,
    "end_ind": 12639
  },
  {
    "text": "they reached the St. Clair home",
    "start_ind": 13175,
    "end_ind": 13206
  },
  {
    "text": "drove up the long winding avenue\nto the house",
    "start_ind": 13211,
    "end_ind": 13256
  },
  {
    "text": "they drew near it",
    "start_ind": 13307,
    "end_ind": 13324
  },
  {
    "text": "she were about to enter a Bluebeard's castle",
    "start_ind": 13447,
    "end_ind": 13491
  },
  {
    "text": "they came up to the house",
    "start_ind": 13622,
    "end_ind": 13647
  },
  {
    "text": "the carriage stopped at the front door",
    "start_ind": 13652,
    "end_ind": 13690
  },
  {
    "text": "They went up massive stone steps",
    "start_ind": 14026,
    "end_ind": 14058
  },
  {
    "text": "front doors which flew open as they reached them",
    "start_ind": 14194,
    "end_ind": 14242
  },
  {
    "text": "she found herself in the great hall",
    "start_ind": 14896,
    "end_ind": 14931
  },
  {
    "text": "they went into the drawing-room",
    "start_ind": 15912,
    "end_ind": 15943
  }
]